  "description": "A unified map component library that wraps Baidu, AMap, Tencent, Tianditu and the enterprise aggregation map API, providing geocoding, reverse geocoding, distance calculation, coordinate conversion and multi-key circuit breaking. 统一地图组件库：封装百度、高德、腾讯、天地图与企业聚合地图接口，提供地理编码、逆地理编码、距离计算、坐标转换与多 Key 熔断能力。",
